NNAAMMEE
       pamcomp - composite (overlay) two Netpbm images together


SSYYNNOOPPSSIISS
       ppaammccoommpp

       [--aalliiggnn=={lleefftt   |   cceenntteerr   |   rriigghhtt  |  bbeeyyoonnddlleefftt  |  bbeeyyoonnddrriigghhtt}]
       [--vvaalliiggnn=={ttoopp | mmiiddddllee | bboottttoomm| aabboovvee |  bbeellooww}]  [--xxooffff==_X]  [--yyooffff==_Y]
       [--aallpphhaa==_a_l_p_h_a_-_p_g_m_f_i_l_e]  [--iinnvveerrtt] [--ooppaacciittyy==_o_p_a_c_i_t_y] [--mmiixxttrraannssppaarreennccyy]
       [--lliinneeaarr] _o_v_e_r_l_a_y___f_i_l_e [_u_n_d_e_r_l_y_i_n_g___f_i_l_e [_o_u_t_p_u_t___f_i_l_e]]

       Minimum unique abbreviation of option is acceptable.  You may use  dou‐
